WEBVTT

00:06:58.289 --> 00:07:01.621
And then my all-time favorite word at this vote,

00:07:01.621 --> 00:07:03.847
which is "multi-slacking."

00:07:03.847 --> 00:07:06.350
(Laughter)

00:07:06.350 --> 00:07:08.633
And multi-slacking is the act

00:07:08.633 --> 00:07:11.501
of having multiple windows up on your screen

00:07:11.501 --> 00:07:12.902
so it looks like you're working

00:07:12.902 --> 00:07:14.996
when you're actually goofing around on the web.

00:07:14.996 --> 00:07:19.825
(Laughter) (Applause)

00:07:21.381 --> 00:07:24.989
Will all of these words stick? Absolutely not.

00:07:24.989 --> 00:07:27.888
And we have made some questionable choices,

00:07:27.888 --> 00:07:29.565
for example in 2006

00:07:29.565 --> 00:07:31.604
when the word of the year was "Plutoed,"